        <briefdescription>
<para>Initialize the state layout for substepping. The state variables are organized as follows: </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>&quot;Substepping_F_n&quot; (9 variables): <ref refid="struct_marmot_material_finite_strain_1_1_deformation" kindref="compound">Deformation</ref> gradient at the start of the global step (F_n).</para>
